#Voltpool
(https://voltpoolg.netlify.app)

Airbnb for EV charging. Charger owners list their home or business chargers, and EV drivers find, book and pay for charging sessions nearby.

Built by Xerxes for Unstop's Build Your MVP – 14 Day Challenge.

# Features
- Drivers:find chargers on a map, book instantly or use Charge now, start securely with a PIN, and use a wallet and coupons
- Hosts: list chargers with photos, set prices by time of day and demand, accept or counter price offers, and chat with drivers
- Admin: a platform overview and support tickets
- Help chat: AI answers, with a built-in FAQ and an option to reach a real person

# Business model
VoltPool takes a 15% commission on every session. It also earns from mobile van charging, Premium plans and featured listings.

# Tech
A single-page web app (HTML, CSS and JavaScript) with a shared data store and a localStorage fallback. It needs no hardware.

